This directory is reserved for PlatformIO Test Runner suites.

Run all tests:
- `C:\Users\PC\.platformio\penv\Scripts\pio.exe test --environment esp32dev`

Run selected test by name:
- `C:\Users\PC\.platformio\penv\Scripts\pio.exe test --environment esp32dev --filter <test_name>`

Reference:
- https://docs.platformio.org/en/latest/advanced/unit-testing/index.html
​